<title>USA: St Lucie County Port, Fla., won by Hough.</title>
<headline>St Lucie County Port, Fla., won by Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R Hough &amp; Co said it won $3.500 million of St Lucie County Port and Airport Authority, Fla., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest of 5.34 percent.</p>
